WEBVTT

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:06.690
Crystal clear.

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:10.940
What kind of face would he make
when he sees this?

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.660
I don't mind
if you wake up and resist me, though.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.410
I want to see your reaction.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:18.490
Chunta.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:23.580
- Chunta.
- Ow.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.170
Chunta?

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.250
A... Thousand yen...

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.590
CHUNTA

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.470
So, who is this Chunta?

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.510
Yes, this is Saijo.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.140
Hey, hello? Anybody there?

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.640
<i>Where's Takato?</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:47.810
<i>An angry tone. How rude.</i>

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.980
Mr. Saijo is sleeping by my side at the moment.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:56.030
<i>He looks so cute when he's asleep.</i>

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:59.620
<i>In fact, he was really cute when awake, too.</i>

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:01.450
Who are you?

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:04.040
<i>Did you do something to Takato?</i>

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:08.630
Who knows? You can ask him yourself later...

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:09.790
Chunta.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.420
Sounds like someone's already claimed him.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:19.260
Well, not that it matters to me.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:02.820
hug6 "Why am I at a hotel with him...
Did we... There's no way... Is there!?"

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.240
<i>My head hurts, and my body feels heavy.</i>

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:08.450
<i>Damn it. That insatiable angel
worked me over again.</i>

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.920
Hey, Chunta.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.590
Nitto Talent Agency
Takato Saijo

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.050
Shut up.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.670
<i>Ayagi!</i>

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.800
Japan Arts Enterprise
Chihiro Ayagi

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.300
<i>What does this mean? Wh-Where's Chunta?</i>

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:27.260
<i>Oh, wait. He's on location.</i>

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.560
<i>Hold on. Calm down!</i>

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.560
<i>This is a hotel?</i>

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:35.440
<i>Last night. Y-Yeah, I went out drinking
with everyone from the show.</i>

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.480
<i>I drank... I drank...</i>

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.110
<i>Why am I in a hotel room with him?</i>

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.030
<i>Don't tell me. No, no way, right?</i>

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.410
<i>That can't... That...</i>

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.410
<i>No way.</i>

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.870
I-I need to go home.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.710
For now, I'll go home.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.960
Wh-Where's my underwear?

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.460
Underwear, under where, th-there it is.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.050
<i>I'm positive nothing happened.</i>

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.220
<i>There's no way.</i>

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:06.140
<i>What am I nervous about? Am I dumb?</i>

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:07.850
To Naka-Meguro.

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:14.190
<i>That's it. I'll have a shower and some coffee
to calm my nerves, then try to recall...</i>

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.780
<i>What did I do?</i>

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.490
<i>My phone battery...</i>

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.120
CHUNTA

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.750
He called all through the night?

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.920
What the hell? A-All right, fine.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.380
I-I'll text him.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:41.670
<i>Huh? Why am I writing such a polite text?</i>

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:45.220
Sorry about last night. After rehearsal, I went
out drinking with Mr. Kitano and the others.
We enjoyed it so much that the time
slipped away. Now I'm at home.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:45.220
<i>Remember. There's nothing
that I should feel guilty about.</i>

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:50.180
<i>Mr. Saijo, I'll make you my woman.</i>

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.430
Y-Yes?!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:57.440
<i>That's unusual for you
to send me a text, Takato.</i>

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.190
Chunta.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.030
Yeah.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.740
You called me several times, so...

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.700
Did I wake you?
So, what is it? Is anything up?

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.490
Is anything up with you, Takato?

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.950
Mitsuya Production
Junta Azumaya

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:11.790
<i>Me?!</i>

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.040
Did anything happen last night?

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.210
<i>N-No, nothing.</i>

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:18.130
<i>I said in my text
that we were all just drinking.</i>

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.500
Is that all?

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.630
<i>That's all.</i>

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.470
Sorry, we start early today.
I'm going to hang up now.

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:28.590
It's your last day today, too, right?
Do a good job.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.800
See you.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:34.100
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:37.730
<i>Trying to smooth it over like that...</i>

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.980
<i>Give me a break.</i>

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:51.280
Mr. Saijo, you went home
without saying anything.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.410
That wasn't nice.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.750
After we spent the night together...

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:02.590
Sorry, after putting you through some trouble.
I'll pay you back for the hotel room.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.800
No problem there.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.630
I had more than my share of fun.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:08.720
Besides...

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:13.600
