It's still clear on my face. He'll find out!</i>

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:20.500
I'll take you straight home today, Takato.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:24.170
If I took you to my place right now,
I would probably lock you up.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.000
Hey, Chunta!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.050
Junta Azumaya.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:33.930
Who's that?
He's nothing like the angel people say.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:38.140
Hey, wh-what are you doing?

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:39.770
I'm washing you.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.350
For example, there.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:43.480
This isn't what...

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:48.230
That man from before, Ayagi,
is the lead in your play, right?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.440
How far did you allow him to go?

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:52.820
I-I didn't—

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:55.370
How far did you let him go with this body?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.160
I didn't! I didn't let him do—

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.080
Then he didn't make love to you?

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.170
No.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.000
Stand up straight, Takato.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.340
I can't hear you. Speak clearly.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:13.050
H-He didn't make love to me.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:16.680
I would never have sex with him.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.510
You don't remember?

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:22.140
No, but I'm sure I didn't.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:27.900
Because... Because no one else
would care about that stuff besides you.

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:33.650
No one else? Takato, do you know
how you look right now?

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:39.030
Look at yourself. Any man would get turned on.

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:43.040
He would want to ravish
and make his partner cry out without shame.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.330
That's not true.

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:48.920
It is true. That's why another man
was able to put his hands on you.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.710
Chunta, wait—

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.130
Where are you going?

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.090
Do you want to run away?

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.640
That's okay. You can run.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:01.270
If you leave this bed,
I won't chase you anymore.

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:05.730
I won't force you.
If you don't like it, we can stop right here.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.560
<i>His voice and gaze are cold.</i>

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:11.280
That's right.

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:15.240
You want a man's body.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.240
No!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:19.620
<i>Stop it! Why are you saying these things?</i>

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.790
Then you don't want it?

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.500
If you want it,
you have to properly tell me, Takato.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:28.040
<i>I've never thought that I wanted a man.</i>

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.500
<i>It's just... It's just you...</i>

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.380
Okay. We're done then.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:34.260
Wait!

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:36.680
I do want it.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.890
Instead of letting another man
give you something like this,

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.730
I should have
completely covered you with mine.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:49.270
I'm sorry, Chunta. I'm sorry.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.240
Morning.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.750
Hey, Chunta?

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.210
I didn't run away.

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:10.080
Why aren't you here?

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.590
