been getting serious lately, Ayagi.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.840
Chihiro Ayagi's Manager
Hajime Mitamaru

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.350
Has something happened?

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.980
I've been serious since the day I was born.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.900
What's this?
Are you sidestepping the question?

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.150
That aside—

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.230
Ayagi.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.400
Are you free right now?

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:45.450
You didn't have sex with him, did you?

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:48.000
What makes you say that?

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.460
If you had, I could tell.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.500
No, I didn't.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:58.880
When I was about to, I gave up with
your damn call oozing with an intent to kill.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.180
Besides...

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:03.140
<i>Well, not that it matters to me.</i>

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.350
<i>Chun... ta...</i>

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:13.520
I'm not shameless enough to screw someone
when they're saying another dude's name

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.070
in their sleep all cute-like.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:21.410
Well, it wouldn't have been fun
just to let him slide away.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:24.410
I don't know if he's surprisingly naive or easy.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:28.080
But he fell right into my trap, and it was funny.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.080
So what happened?

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.630
If you're going to break up,
I'll take him off your hands.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.550
It's been a while since
someone's gotten under my skin.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:44.640
Hey, you should
really consider letting me have—

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:47.640
By the way, Chihiro Ayagi...

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:51.390
I've heard rumors that
you pillow-talked your way up the ladder.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:52.560
Is that true?

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.810
Go right ahead.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:12:00.360
The women I've bedded
are all proud high-society types.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:03.410
They're just like me, compartmentalize
and go about their business.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:07.030
Unless you want to be like me
and use your body to encourage them?

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.750
I could even introduce you to them if you like.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.790
No, I've heard enough.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.880
Oh. You sure are quick to back off.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:18.670
Are you sure it's okay?
I'm serious about snatching Mr. Saijo away.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.090
Whatever.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:23.760
I don't care who
or how many people want Takato.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.350
I'm never going to let him go
and won't let him get away either.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.310
A future where Takato belongs
to someone other than me doesn't exist.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:34.310
You were lucky this time.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:38.190
I don't want to ruin this job for him
by beating the hell out of the lead.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.690
But if you ever intend to mess things up again,

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:45.530
you'd better be prepared
to regret a whole lot of things.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.120
Well, thank you for your time.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:51.370
Have a good evening.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.160
Lame.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:56.500
What's he so pissed about?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.500
And what am I doing
taking the whole thing seriously?

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.710
Lame.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.010
