Takato

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.430
Takato!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.520
Welcome back.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:17.650
I ended up using this.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:22.030
It felt weird. I mean,
all the times you brought me here...

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:25.450
So when I finally opened the door by myself,
I was perplexed.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.740
Takato, why did you come here?

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.660
No reason.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.500
I felt bad about giving it back to you
without even using it once.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.500
Is that all?

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.960
What do you mean, is that all?

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.420
Should I have added, "I missed you,"

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:45.340
or "I want to have sex one last time"
and cling to you?

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.890
I'm just asking you.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.760
Did you really just come here
to return this to me?

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:56.190
Are you here right now just for that, Takato?

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:02.190
It's because... I really... like you.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:03.900
Hey, give it...

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.870
Takato.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.960
Ch-Chunta.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.120
I didn't run away.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.000
I know.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.710
I didn't run away.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:22.630
I know.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.710
Takato, I'm sorry I made you cry.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.880
I'm sorry I scared you.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.760
I'm sorry that I've fallen in love with you so much.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.140
Chunta, I...

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.770
