00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.270
We make love all the time, so I can tell.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.240
You haven't made love to anyone but me.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.780
Really?

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:52.120
Thank goodness. Thank goodness.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:57.000
Takato, from here out,
I don't care who falls for you.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.710
I'm not giving you up to anyone.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.460
I really am scary, aren't I?

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:08.420
<i>Ever since I was a kid, I've been blessed with
work and fans by being in this business,</i>

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:12.600
<i>but no one has ever loved me like this.</i>

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:13.930
That is scary.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:18.430
Thank you for still saying that you really like me.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:23.650
<i>After being loved this much,
just the thought of being abandoned...</i>

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:25.980
You scare me.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:32.620
This mark, can I erase it with my own?

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:37.540
