and you intend to make it dark again?

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.500
Good point.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.460
I'm just frustrated,
because you never let me give you one.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:46.750
You can give me one,
but do it in a place that doesn't stand out.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.510
