00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:49.670
Hey!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:52.220
H-Hey, where are you...

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.800
A place where you can't see it either, Takato.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.930
